  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deploying productive use of renewable energy appliances in refugee camps and host communities in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will aim to increase economic activities and improve livelihood opportunities by empowering refugee and host community members with the capacity to run small-scale businesses and increasing their access to electricity for productive use of renewable energy (PURE), through connections to off-grid electricity and access to customized PUE appliances.</narrative>
  </description>
